<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-lg p-6">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">Available Landing Pages</h2>
  
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200">
      <thead class="bg-gray-50">
        <tr>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Page Name</th>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Target Audience</th>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">URL Path</th>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Actions</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">CFO Landing Page</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-500">CFOs & Financial Leaders</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-blue-600">/landing_pages/cfo</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium">
            <a href="<%= landing_pages_cfo_path %>" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-900" target="_blank">View</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Small Business Landing Page</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-500">Small Business Owners</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-blue-600">/landing_pages/small_business</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium">
            <a href="<%= landing_pages_small_business_path %>" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-900" target="_blank">View</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">QuickBooks Landing Page</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-gray-500">QuickBooks Users</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-blue-600">/landing_pages/quickbooks</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium">
            <a href="<%= landing_pages_quickbooks_path %>" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-900" target="_blank">View</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="bg-blue-50">
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-blue-800">Feature Flag Test</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-blue-600">A/B Testing with PostHog</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-blue-600">/landing_page_test</td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium">
            <a href="<%= landing_page_test_path %>" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-900" target="_blank">Test Now</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded text-sm text-blue-800">
    <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Usage Tips:</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Add UTM parameters to track traffic sources: <code>?utm_source=facebook&utm_campaign=spring_promo&utm_medium=social</code></li>
      <li>All landing pages use the same lead capture component for consistent data collection</li>
      <li>PostHog analytics are automatically tracked for each page variant</li>
      <li>Use the Feature Flag Test for A/B testing with the <code>landing-page-variant</code> feature flag</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-6 border border-green-200 bg-green-50 p-4 rounded text-sm text-green-800">
    <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">PostHog Feature Flag Setup:</h3>
    <p class="mb-3">For A/B testing with the Feature Flag Test page, use this configuration in PostHog:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Create a multivariate feature flag named <code>landing-page-variant</code></li>
      <li>Add variants: <code>cfo</code>, <code>small_business</code>, and <code>quickbooks</code></li>
      <li>Set percentage rollout for each variant (e.g., 33% each for equal distribution)</li>
      <li>Configure user targeting rules if needed to target specific user groups</li>
      <li>Drive traffic to <code>/landing_page_test</code> to test all variants</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>